//OUT="00 "

// The counterpart of 32 for an explicit level: two `if` blocks sit between the
// `brk 2` and the inner loop, and neither may be counted. The 2 has to reach
// past both loops.

fn main
    for i 0..2
        for j 0..2
            out "{i}{j} "
            if true
                if true
                    brk 2
